Comment: 9,0:23:29.26,0:23:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:01:32.49,0:01:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Listen carefully, Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:36.62,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just as land\Ncovers 30% of the planet
Dialogue: 9,0:01:38.96,0:01:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and water covers 70%,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:43.67,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a certain number of souls\Nthat can inhabit this planet.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:48.17,0:01:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The more humans populate the Earth,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the less room other organisms\Nhave to live.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:58.31,0:02:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The total number of souls remains constant.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:03.02,0:02:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, suppose\Nthere was a way for a human
Dialogue: 9,0:02:07.82,0:02:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to possess dozens,\Nno, hundreds of thousands of souls.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:12.20,0:02:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of show\Nwould that human put on?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:15.20,0:02:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the future hold for such a human?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't the slightest idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:24.92,0:02:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's an interesting thought.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:28.88,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:33.42,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max,
Dialogue: 9,0:02:35.22,0:02:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,about this bone,
Dialogue: 9,0:02:38.98,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to put him\Nthrough something.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Try bringing it back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a human bone?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:49.61,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does it belong to?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.78,0:02:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.20,0:02:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it comes from an old friend.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:56.04,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to bring it back to life,\Nbut it's such a tiny piece.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you mean to imply that\Nthe rest of the skeleton is somewhere?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can a single bone\Neven be brought back to life?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:08.88,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last of his bones.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:13.05,0:03:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else has been turned to dust.\NNothing remains in this world.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must try,\NSports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:20.60,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail,\Nthere's no need for me to remind you
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.81,0:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that the power I gave you\Nwill no longer be yours.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:27.61,0:03:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.86,0:03:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already tried.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already done.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's the bone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Dio's bone?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to it?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's his bone? Tell me!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.22,0:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell should I know!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:00.73,0:04:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This bone isn't normal, is it?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.44,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This bone escapes my power.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.45,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It moves on its own.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I sense its presence.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.08,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it. It's moving not far from here.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.67,0:04:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it! Come on, fetch!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.54,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sports Max.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:36.21,0:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This proves his theory.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.26,0:04:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be possible\Nto reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.02,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't chase the bone.\NLeave it alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.36,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the bone wander freely.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will simply\Nobserve its movements.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:56.07,0:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I will connect it\Nto Jotaro Kujo's memory{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I will know the truth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I sense the bone's presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.62,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's in the\Nultra-high-security ward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:06.29,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone must have picked it up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.29,0:05:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Sports Max's memory.\NHermes found it by chance.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.22,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Jolyne has already seen it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.47,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So Jolyne got herself punished on purpose
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.31,0:05:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to be locked up\Nin the ultra-high-security ward and find that bone!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It was madness.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake must know we read\NSports Max's memory.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do everything he can
Dialogue: 9,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to eliminate Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.61,0:05:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne won't last long\Nin there all alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.33,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I exist like this, it's thanks to her.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what I can do.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to help me.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.17,0:05:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible. Even Weather Report,\Nwho's recovering in the infirmary,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,can't reach\Nthat part of the prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to help you, but...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:04.01,0:06:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The maximum security disciplinary wing,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:06.43,0:06:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,in other words, the ultra-high-security ward,\Nis southeast of the men's prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.77,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To reach it, you first\Nhave to leave the prison by car.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.61,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's\Nno secret passage in there.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.65,0:06:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been there, actually.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.73,0:06:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I really don't know\Nhow to protect Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm asking of you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:27.66,0:06:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to get me\Ninto the ultra-high-security ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.33,0:06:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you help us?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.26,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't help you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.22,0:06:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Annasui will never cooperate.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.93,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's a Stand user, isn't he?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you born with your power?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.31,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count on Annasui, I tell you.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.86,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He never cooperates with anyone,\Nno matter the reason.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.86,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to do anything.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.95,0:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take me\Nto the ultra-high-security ward,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.75,TiretsDefault,,528,0,0,,– I'll do anything for you...\N– Stop it, F.F.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.88,0:07:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the type to help others.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to say is...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.88,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never\Nheard of Annasui?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an assassin.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.39,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,His full name is Narciso Annasui.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since he was a little kid,\Nfor some inexplicable reason,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,he's had a peculiar habit.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:39.65,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not really a habit.\NMore like a syndrome.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:43.86,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This syndrome forces him\Nto take apart anything he can.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:47.86,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything he sees, he takes apart.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was ten,\Nhe took apart his neighbor's Porsche
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and was committed for six months.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, he took apart\Na high-voltage telephone pole.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.29,0:08:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And when he was 21,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.34,0:08:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he showed up one day\Nat his girlfriend's place
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.68,0:08:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and found her in bed with another man.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He took their bodies apart on the spot
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so they could never\Nbe together again.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The psychiatric evaluation conducted\Nafter his arrest
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,revealed nothing abnormal, oddly enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how\Nhe ended up at the Aquarium.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.54,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Weather Report\Nmanaging to control him,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,God knows what he could do.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who Annasui is.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So drop it, please.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:41.58,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet, I can't go\Nget Jolyne on my own.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.47,0:08:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need support.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.26,0:08:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't succeed without his help.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.43,0:08:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what a strange feeling...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he refuses,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.98,0:09:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll try to force him with my power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.23,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.11,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't picture a single blow\Nthat would land on him successfully.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't even know where to aim.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.78,0:09:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I don't try to kill him,\Nhe won't listen to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what I sense from him.\NBut I have to try anyway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I came here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go defend her.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:27.55,0:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo, I mean.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cooperate.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:34.35,0:09:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she wants to find that bone,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help with that, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.52,0:09:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.31,0:09:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be under attack\Nas we speak.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Annasui!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you scheming?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I scheming?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect her with all my strength.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.75,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:05.17,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a liking to her
Dialogue: 9,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,head to toe, the moment I first saw her.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.51,0:10:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She went to the ultra-high-security ward\Nof her own will to save her father.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:16.43,0:10:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her strength of conviction\Ncharms me all the more.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.72,0:10:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I protect her successfully\Nto the very end, I'll marry her.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.65,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my conditions.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.61,0:10:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,F.F., was it?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.07,0:10:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd do anything.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then give us your blessing.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:36.37,0:10:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A marriage must be blessed.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he'd do what?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:51.76,0:10:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Down!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.61,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.45,0:11:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The attack happened after a delay,\Nand it came from the wall.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:25.83,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of Annasui's Stand,\NDiver Down.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your blessing.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.68,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious about one thing, Dio.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.57,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the Stands you've seen,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:51.02,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,which was the weakest?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.24,0:11:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be one you met\Nduring your travels around the world,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.45,0:12:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,or one that was created.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't say.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.00,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What counts as adequate\Ndiffers for everyone.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A king has his strengths...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and a cook has his.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.13,0:12:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's life.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same with Stands.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.43,0:12:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The concept of strength or weakness\Ndoesn't really apply.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I misspoke.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids often wonder,\Nfor example:
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Who's stronger,\NStallone or Van Damme?"
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's work with that.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.32,0:12:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The weakest is a Stand\NI named Survivor.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.03,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, it's difficult to handle.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:38.99,0:12:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor? That sounds powerful.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in 1982.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.08,0:12:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In France, in Lorraine,\Na group of six hikers
Dialogue: 9,0:12:50.21,0:12:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,disappeared, and all were found dead.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.13,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The investigation revealed
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.34,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that all six of them\Nhad fought in the mountains.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.09,0:13:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Beaten to death.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:04.81,0:13:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Men and women alike,\Nthey pushed their muscles so hard
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.77,0:13:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that their bones broke.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A tooth flew out on a punch,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,split a boulder and stayed lodged in it.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Such was the brutality of that fight.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:18.65,0:13:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner himself was unable\Nto climb back down because of his injuries.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:25.03,0:13:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I found out later.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:27.62,0:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All six of them had slept\Nat an inn the night before they died.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.96,0:13:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They had quarreled with the innkeeper.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the women
Dialogue: 9,0:13:35.38,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,had mocked the innkeeper,\Nsaying he stank.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.60,0:13:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that innkeeper\Nwas a Stand user.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.93,0:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But what did the innkeeper do to them?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did all six\Nof them kill each other?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.52,0:13:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is, he did nothing at all.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:53.48,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He did nothing to them,\Nbut a slight anger
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,had risen in his mind.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that slight anger
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,converted\Ninto a small electric potential
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.45,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that traveled down\Nhis nervous system to the ground.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Stand called Survivor.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric current traveled through the ground
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.92,0:14:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to the six hikers.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.42,0:14:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground and their shoes\Nmust have been damp,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and the electricity traveled easily.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.18,0:14:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric potential\Nof nervous system signals
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.06,0:14:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is very small, just 70 millivolts.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This Stand feeds\Non those small pulses of energy.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.90,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor's attacks\Nare undetectable and painless.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.74,0:14:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't harm humans,\Nand it doesn't control them.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't inflict pain\Nor put anyone to sleep.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.33,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This Stand does none of that.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.87,0:14:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It merely awakens\Nits victim's anger.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:53.87,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It stimulates the limbic system\Nof the human brain just enough
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to awaken its fighting instincts.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.67,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, one woman's mockery\Nof the innkeeper's body odor
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,drove the six hikers\Nto fight to the death.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.81,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it was difficult to handle.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.65,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely useless, even.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unable\Nto tell friend from foe.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.23,0:15:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If subordinates fought\Namong each other,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,their organization would collapse.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give me that power?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to use it,\NI'll just take the Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.83,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, I extract the power\Nand store it on a disc?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one is different.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.34,0:15:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll find\Nits use someday.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.43,0:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,These mushrooms must be edible.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.81,0:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty good.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To the showers!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:03.82,0:16:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet, FE40536!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:11.16,0:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blinded!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.41,0:16:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got her!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hiding!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a filthy cockroach!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.46,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This cell is mine.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.34,0:16:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 20 dollars in winnings total!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:25.47,0:16:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. I've only got 15 dollars on me.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll do, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:31.43,0:16:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you've got, it'll do.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In any case,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.81,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what I have to do\Nis find the bone with my string.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this bone doing here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:45.82,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know yet,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.82,0:16:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it's somewhere in this ultra-high-security ward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.87,0:16:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does someone have it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.25,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'm the one who finds it first,\NWhitesnake will come after me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he'll have{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.96,0:17:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my father's memory disc\Nin his hand!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.47,0:17:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you could get up?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.72,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you think the Marlins\Nwill do tonight?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't stand much of a chance of winning.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:23.82,0:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Their pitcher got slammed\Nby that reporter of his.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to mess everything up.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to bet\Nyour 15 dollars on that?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you broke already?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.33,0:17:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\Nhe's going to pitch terribly.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:39.29,0:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's a good pitcher.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too easy.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for the game to start.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The valve doesn't close right.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.31,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.56,0:18:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go change\Nin the main building.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hit me?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.45,0:18:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologized.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't splash you on purpose.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I just hit you?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem, bastard?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit you that hard.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You want more?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.30,0:18:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to\Nhit me so hard, you bastard.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.76,TiretsDefault,,819,0,0,,– Bastard!\N– Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.81,0:18:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, stop.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.98,0:18:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, I said.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.69,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. My apologies.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:47.94,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lend you my uniform\Nif you don't have a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're even, okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.53,0:18:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What got into you? Calm down.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.49,0:19:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In a bad mood today?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.17,0:19:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:08.88,0:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit like a maniac, you shit!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on if you're a man!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into them?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:20.89,0:19:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:23.43,0:19:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm getting all excited.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His body...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.65,0:19:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can see where his strength lies!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His superbly developed muscles!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's beautiful...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.66,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel the structure\Nof his strongest muscles!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.16,0:19:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fighting is wonderful!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to their bodies?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.17,0:19:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are\Nthese things that seem to glow?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.46,0:19:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am.\NI'll show you who's the strongest!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this an enemy attack?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could this guard be an enemy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.87,0:20:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, the enemy hasn't shown itself yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.46,0:20:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But this is a Stand power!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This creepy feeling,\Nit must be a Stand attack!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do not give\Nwhat is holy to the dogs,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"lest they trample it underfoot,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:38.47,0:20:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"turn around,\Nand tear you to pieces."
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Matthew 7:6.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.31,0:20:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max has disappeared.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:48.94,0:20:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they\Nfound out about it,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.03,0:20:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I must face the facts:\Nthey read his memory.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:57.24,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of Stand users\NI've sent to the ultra-high-security ward...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:01.70,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolyne Kujo entered the ultra-high-security ward
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.50,0:21:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to find Dio's bone...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:15.67,0:21:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't\Nlet her live any longer.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.97,0:21:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use all my strength to eliminate her!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.51,0:21:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens inside the ultra-high-security ward\Ndoesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.06,0:21:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All four of them will fight
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.40,0:21:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,until Jotaro's daughter\Nis eliminated!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent everything he had.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:42.78,0:21:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see where your strength lies!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:45.87,0:21:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see from here
Dialogue: 9,0:21:51.46,0:21:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the strongest parts\Nof every fighter's body!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:56.80,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fight Club time!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.05,0:22:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a brawl!
